/* Rendered from demo-toolbar.js.tmpl by scripts/render.sh.
 *
 * SeamlessAccess demo toolbar (Figma frames 2543:9402 bar, 2543:9495 hidden
 * chip, 2627:898 mode dropdown — see ../design-updates-2026-08.md). One shared
 * self-injecting script, bind-mounted into both SP containers and included by
 * all four demo pages as <script src="/demo-toolbar/demo-toolbar.js" defer>.
 *
 * Behavior implemented now: hide/show toggle (collapses to a small chip,
 * persisted), Example dropdown navigates between the content sites, and the
 * Integration Mode choice is persisted and broadcast as a "sa:demo-mode"
 * event on document. The SP2 pages consume the mode: advanced (default)
 * shows their custom button + /discovery/ page, standard shows the thiss.js
 * DiscoveryComponent. SP1 does not react to the mode yet.
 *
 * No JS template literals in this file: render.sh runs envsubst over it, so
 * every ${...} must be one of the allowlisted deployment vars.
